{"618440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stencil of Judgement", "steam_appid": 618440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Omega Force (Musou) meets Team Ninja</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against other overpowered bosses and blow them away with your destructive abilities. Players venture into procedurally generated dungeon runs, battling hordes of enemies and elite bosses. Each victory yields randomized loot - weapons, armor, and magical artifacts - across rarity tiers, each with unique stats and affixes. The core loop is simple yet endlessly replayable: fight, loot, upgrade, repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/85b52264155d9a7f6674acd18f0e01ea.poster.avif?t=1773761780\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/85b52264155d9a7f6674acd18f0e01ea.webm?t=1773761780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/85b52264155d9a7f6674acd18f0e01ea.mp4?t=1773761780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/23e59f0ab5bf7a651e1e708409c9cc18.avif?t=1773761780\" width=1560 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat emphasizes precision, rhythm, and choice. Players can chain light and heavy attacks, weave in parries and dodges, and unleash devastating magical abilities. Enemies demand different strategies, and loot encourages experimentation with builds, from tanky melee bruisers to agile magic-focused glass cannons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/30d9b637004b752bea1c08d54d14dda5.poster.avif?t=1773761780\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/30d9b637004b752bea1c08d54d14dda5.webm?t=1773761780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/30d9b637004b752bea1c08d54d14dda5.mp4?t=1773761780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/23b40d490e7f9d0f2f7f06046eeccf10.avif?t=1773761780\" width=1560 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the truly elite, we offer adrenaline-fueled raid encounters that push the boundaries of your combat prowess. These large-scale, multi-phase battles against formidable adversaries will demand flawless coordination, split-second timing, and a deep understanding of the combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed in these raids, and you'll be rewarded with the rarest and most powerful loot in the game - items that grant unparalleled abilities and open up new strategic possibilities. Fail, and you'll face the humbling consequences of your shortcomings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/273870d13958ad53eddf5f6ed6cffa95.poster.avif?t=1773761780\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/273870d13958ad53eddf5f6ed6cffa95.webm?t=1773761780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/273870d13958ad53eddf5f6ed6cffa95.mp4?t=1773761780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/00e8891e34027c7c8c3308aa9298bca8.avif?t=1773761780\" width=1560 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into our sprawling, multi-tiered dungeons that grow increasingly treacherous with each descent. Navigate labyrinthine corridors, overcome devious traps, and confront powerful boss encounters that test the limits of your skill and resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you plunge deeper, the challenges will mount - from swarming hordes of bloodthirsty foes to elite guardians wielding devastating abilities. Only the most daring and masterful players will survive the dungeon's darkest reaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/5b444ca32354532a5f74c7f212df8c86.poster.avif?t=1773761780\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/5b444ca32354532a5f74c7f212df8c86.webm?t=1773761780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/5b444ca32354532a5f74c7f212df8c86.mp4?t=1773761780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Omega Force (Musou) meets Team Ninja</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against other overpowered bosses and blow them away with your destructive abilities. Players venture into procedurally generated dungeon runs, battling hordes of enemies and elite bosses. Each victory yields randomized loot - weapons, armor, and magical artifacts - across rarity tiers, each with unique stats and affixes. The core loop is simple yet endlessly replayable: fight, loot, upgrade, repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/85b52264155d9a7f6674acd18f0e01ea.poster.avif?t=1773761780\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/85b52264155d9a7f6674acd18f0e01ea.webm?t=1773761780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/85b52264155d9a7f6674acd18f0e01ea.mp4?t=1773761780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/23e59f0ab5bf7a651e1e708409c9cc18.avif?t=1773761780\" width=1560 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat emphasizes precision, rhythm, and choice. Players can chain light and heavy attacks, weave in parries and dodges, and unleash devastating magical abilities. Enemies demand different strategies, and loot encourages experimentation with builds, from tanky melee bruisers to agile magic-focused glass cannons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/30d9b637004b752bea1c08d54d14dda5.poster.avif?t=1773761780\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/30d9b637004b752bea1c08d54d14dda5.webm?t=1773761780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/30d9b637004b752bea1c08d54d14dda5.mp4?t=1773761780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/23b40d490e7f9d0f2f7f06046eeccf10.avif?t=1773761780\" width=1560 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the truly elite, we offer adrenaline-fueled raid encounters that push the boundaries of your combat prowess. These large-scale, multi-phase battles against formidable adversaries will demand flawless coordination, split-second timing, and a deep understanding of the combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed in these raids, and you'll be rewarded with the rarest and most powerful loot in the game - items that grant unparalleled abilities and open up new strategic possibilities. Fail, and you'll face the humbling consequences of your shortcomings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/273870d13958ad53eddf5f6ed6cffa95.poster.avif?t=1773761780\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/273870d13958ad53eddf5f6ed6cffa95.webm?t=1773761780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618440/extras/273870d13958ad53eddf5f6ed6cffa95.mp4?t=1773761780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">